# Reproducible image and chart builds need these tracked despite the
# broad globs above. Add narrow exceptions only — never weaken the
# globs themselves, which protect against accidental commits of
# generated artifacts (workflow logs, CSV result dumps, secret-y JSON).
!uv.lock
!helm/**/templates/NOTES.txt